sequenceDiagram
    participant N8N as n8nWorkflow
    participant API as N8NWebhookAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    N8N->>API: POST webhook(type=knowledge,payload)
    activate API
    API->>API: validate payload structure

    alt payload.type == knowledge
        API->>DB: INSERT Knowbase(source,title,content,raw_data)
        activate DB
        DB-->>API: insert success
        deactivate DB
        API-->>N8N: success
    else payload type อื่น
        API-->>N8N: ignored or generic success
    end
    deactivate API

